Subject: [PATCH 2/5] SourceSharp: relocate definitions into three shared
 headers

ammodef.h, interval.h and mapentities_shared.h carry inline definitions
taken from ammodef.cpp, interval.cpp and mapentities_shared.cpp, so
SourceSharp can use them without compiling those .cpp files. The .cpp files
themselves are unchanged.
